                            Rexx/SQL
                       for MS ODBC (3.0+)
                       Win9x/Me/NT/2k/XP


This archive contains the executables for Rexx/SQL for the builtin 32bit
ODBC drivers that are provided with Windows; both .exe and .dll's.

Rexx/SQL is distributed under the terms of the GNU Library General Public
License. See the enclosed file COPYING-LIB for details.

Rexx/SQL supports either the Regina Rexx interpreter; version 0.08c
or above, IBM's Object Rexx, Enterprise Rexx, or Quercus Systems
Personal Rexx for Win95/NT.

A test script; tester.cmd is also provided.  It should thoroughly test
all aspects of Rexx/SQL.  It can be run either with the enclosed
REXXSQL.EXE or with the Rexx executable supplied by the Rexx interpreter
you are using. Run via the Rexx interpreter, the REXXSQL.DLL is used.

Source code for Rexx/SQL for Windows and other operating systems and
source and executables for other database packages are available from
    http://rexxsql.sf.net/

Online HTML, documentation is available from
    http://rexxsql.sf.net/doc/

                            **********
I have had problems with the supplied 3.0 ODBC drivers and driver manager.
Please let me know if this combination of drivers works on your machine.
